Package: bootei
Title: Bootstrap Ensemble Tie-Breaking for Permutation Tests
Description: Implements BOOTstrap Ensemble Inference (BOOTEI), a generic refinement
    for discrete permutation tests in low-resolution regimes such as small samples,
    sparse contingency tables, few outcome levels, and pervasive ties. The method
    preserves the original permutation test statistic and augments it with a bootstrap
    ensemble score used solely to deterministically break ties in the permutation
    reference distribution. By reusing a fixed bootstrap plan across permutations,
    BOOTEI retains finite-sample validity under exchangeability and yields permutation
    p-values that are never larger than those from the classical permutation test.
